        "text": "I think the first thing is start small. Don't invest a lot of money very quickly, and don't invest in using money that you will need in the next six months or so or even longer. So only use money that you don't really need in a hurry. And second advice would be don't follow advices on Twitter. Everyone's financial situation is different. Number three is only invest in a small number of projects that you know well, that you have time to follow in a lot of depth. So instead of investing in 50 or 100 coins, just invest in 2 to 3 coins that you know well. This way, whenever there's a piece of news, you know what the impacts are.",
